18→ * Contract: Maintains a static registry of all in-JVM transport instances keyed by
19→ * {@link NodeAddress}. Messages are delivered by directly invoking the target's registered
20→ * handler — no serialization or networking occurs. Thread-safe via concurrent data structures.
